msgid "退出"
msgstr "Quit"

msgid "选择已安装的大游戏，确认后创建真实联机房间。"
msgstr "Choose an installed main game to create an online room."

msgid "通过 IP 或域名加入房主 · 房间发现服务暂未开放"
msgstr "Connect by IP or hostname · Room discovery is not available yet"

msgid "键盘与鼠标"
msgstr "Keyboard & Mouse"

msgid "方向键"
msgstr "Arrows"

