msgstr "Collapse panel"

msgid "展开面板"
msgstr "Expand panel"

msgid "监听网卡 / IP"
msgstr "Listen Interface / IP"

msgid "刷新"
msgstr "Refresh"

msgid "请选择监听网卡 / IP"
msgstr "Select a listen interface / IP"

msgid "不可用：{address}（请重新选择）"
msgstr "Unavailable: {address} (select again)"

msgid "所选监听 IP 已不可用，请刷新并重新选择"
msgstr "The selected listen IP is unavailable. Refresh and select again."

msgid "游戏菜单"
msgstr "Game menu"

msgid "Esc 返回游戏"
msgstr "Esc to resume"

msgid "返回游戏"
msgstr "Resume game"

msgid "框架设置"
msgstr "Framework settings"

msgid "小游戏设置"
msgstr "Minigame settings"

msgid "返回大厅"
msgstr "Return to lobby"

msgid "选择本机监听 IP；隧道转发目标需与此匹配。请允许 UDP 端口通过防火墙。"
msgstr "Choose a local listen IP matching the tunnel target. Allow the UDP port through the firewall."

msgid "玩家与延迟"
msgstr "Players & latency"

msgid "名次"
msgstr "Rank"

msgid "主游戏成绩"
msgstr "Main game results"

msgid "松开 Tab 关闭 · F3 查看总积分"
msgstr "Release Tab to close · F3 for overall scores"

msgid "延迟为玩家与房主之间的往返时间；其他玩家的数据由房主提供。"
msgstr "Latency is the round-trip time to the host. Other players’ readings are reported by the host."

msgid "玩家"
msgstr "Player"

msgid "至房主 RTT"
msgstr "RTT to host"

msgid "连接状态"
msgstr "Connection"

msgid "你"
msgstr "You"

msgid "房主"
msgstr "Host"

msgid "已掉线"
msgstr "Disconnected"

msgid "测量中"
msgstr "Measuring"

msgid "正常"
msgstr "Good"

msgid "波动较大"
msgstr "Unstable"

msgid "无响应"
msgstr "Unresponsive"

msgid "丢包率"
msgstr "Packet loss"

msgid "丢包率为可靠包估计，约每 10 秒更新并平滑；自己的行显示上行，其他玩家显示房主下行。"
msgstr "Reliable-packet loss estimate, updated about every 10 seconds and smoothed. Your row shows client-to-host traffic; other rows show host-to-player traffic."

msgid "网络实验"
msgstr "Network lab"

msgid "房主侧"
msgstr "Host side"

msgid "客机侧"
msgstr "Client side"

msgid "启用网络模拟"
msgstr "Enable network simulation"

msgid "额外发送延迟"
msgstr "Added outgoing delay"

msgid "随机发送丢包率"
msgstr "Random outgoing packet loss"

msgid "仅影响本机下次以此身份建立的游戏连接；不会修改其他玩家的本地设置。"
msgstr "Applies to your next game connection in this role. Other players keep their own local settings."

msgid "每个发出 UDP 包增加的单向等待时间。双方各增加 100 ms 时，往返时间约增加 200 ms。"
msgstr "One-way delay added to every outgoing UDP datagram. Adding 100 ms at each end increases the round trip by about 200 ms."

msgid "每个发出 UDP 包独立丢弃的概率，包含握手、确认和重传。100% 会阻止连接；Tab 中的可靠包估计不等于此概率。"
msgstr "Independent drop probability per outgoing UDP datagram, including handshakes, acknowledgements and retries. 100% prevents connection. The reliable-packet estimate in Tab is a different metric."

msgid "设置仅保存在本机，下次连接生效。房主侧影响本机发往客机的包；客机侧影响本机发往房主的包。可靠消息仍由 ENet 重传，原生 RPC、语音和时钟同步都会受到影响。"
msgstr "Local settings apply on the next connection. Host settings affect packets sent to clients; client settings affect packets sent to the host. ENet still retries reliable messages. Native RPC, voice and clock synchronization are affected."

msgid "保存实验设置"
msgstr "Save lab settings"

msgid "默认关闭。先修改草稿，再保存；离开此页不会自动保存。"
msgstr "Disabled by default. Edit the draft, then save. Leaving this page does not save automatically."

msgid "实验设置保存失败："
msgstr "Could not save lab settings: "

msgid "实验设置已保存，下次创建或加入房间时生效。"
msgstr "Lab settings saved. They apply when you next host or join a room."

msgid "内容包"
msgstr "Content packages"

msgid "主游戏"
msgstr "Main games"

msgid "小游戏"
msgstr "Minigames"

msgid "搜索名称或 ID"
msgstr "Search name or ID"

msgid "继承协议"
msgstr "Inherited protocol"

msgid "配置本机设置"
msgstr "Configure local settings"

msgid "选择内容包，查看说明并配置本机设置。"
msgstr "Select a package to view details and configure local settings."

msgid "没有匹配的内容包。"
msgstr "No matching packages."

msgid "仅游戏自身设置（无可用协议）"
msgstr "Game settings only (no available protocol)"

msgid "配置文件："
msgstr "Preferences file:"

msgid "协议覆盖文件："
msgstr "Protocol override file:"

msgid "修改后点击应用保存；房间规则仍在大厅中配置。"
msgstr "Click Apply to save changes; room rules are configured in the lobby."
